          "id": "b5b4b834-cd8e-4227-a33c-3665acfbdb7b",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">HTTP // GUIDE</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">01/06</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"display:inline-block;background:rgba(34,211,238,0.1);border:1px solid #22D3EE;color:#22D3EE;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:20px;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:36px;\">DEV TIP #14</div>\n          <h1 style=\"font-size:82px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:28px;\">Tu confonds encore <span style=\"color:#22D3EE;\">401</span> et <span style=\"color:#A855F7;\">403</span> ?</h1>\n          <p style=\"font-size:28px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">La différence cruciale expliquée en 60 secondes.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:32px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">@LeDevCodeur</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">SWIPE &gt;&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
          "order": 0,
          "notes": "Slide 1 - Hook"
        },
        {
          "id": "e612cd74-1e9b-4f86-b10f-cb037a447a93",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">2xx // SUCCES</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">02/06</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:56px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:32px;color:#F8FAFC;\">200 OK vs 201 Created</h2>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:1px solid #1E293B;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;color:#22D3EE;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">✓ 200 OK</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Requête traitée avec succès. Standard pour les lectures (GET) ou mises à jour (PUT).</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:1px solid #1E293B;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;color:#A855F7;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">✓ 201 Created</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Une ressource a été créée sur le serveur suite à un POST.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:32px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">@LeDevCodeur</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">SWIPE &gt;&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
          "order": 1,
          "notes": "Slide 2 - 200 vs 201"
        },
        {
          "id": "5b651347-5cde-4b7c-8c74-a3a63a7841c1",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">4xx // CLIENT ERROR</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">03/06</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:56px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:28px;color:#F8FAFC;\">400 Bad Request</h2>\n          <p style=\"font-size:28px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:32px;\">Le serveur refuse la requête car le payload JSON envoyé est invalide ou incomplet.</p>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:1px solid #1E293B;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:16px;\">// Payload invalide reçu :</div>\n            <pre style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;color:#F8FAFC;line-height:1.5;\"><code>{\n  <span style=\"color:#22D3EE;\">\"email\"</span>: <span style=\"color:#A855F7;\">\"not-an-email\"</span>,\n  <span style=\"color:#94A3B8;\">// Erreur : format invalide !</span>\n}</code></pre>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:32px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">@LeDevCodeur</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">SWIPE &gt;&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
          "order": 2,
          "notes": "Slide 3 - 400 Bad Request"
        },
        {
          "id": "6fb98c16-3826-44de-b3a6-152d9279ffaf",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">SECURITE // AUTH</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">04/06</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:56px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:32px;color:#F8FAFC;\">401 vs 403 : Le piège</h2>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border-left:6px solid #22D3EE;border-radius:0 16px 16px 0;padding:32px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;color:#22D3EE;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">401 Unauthorized = Qui es-tu ?</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Tu n'es pas connecté. Le token est manquant ou expiré. (Authentification)</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border-left:6px solid #A855F7;border-radius:0 16px 16px 0;padding:32px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:26px;color:#A855F7;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">403 Forbidden = Pas le droit !</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Je sais qui tu es, mais tu n'as pas les permissions pour cette ressource. (Autorisation)</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:32px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">@LeDevCodeur</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">SWIPE &gt;&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
          "order": 3,
          "notes": "Slide 4 - 401 vs 403"
        },
        {
          "id": "ebb9cdeb-7712-4156-a925-9171a315aa34",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">5xx // SERVER CRASH</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">05/06</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:56px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:32px;color:#F8FAFC;\">500 vs 504 : Côté serveur</h2>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:1px solid #1E293B;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;color:#22D3EE;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">500 Internal Server Error</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Un bug non géré a fait planter le code backend pendant son exécution.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:1px solid #1E293B;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:24px;color:#A855F7;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:bold;\">504 Gateway Timeout</div>\n            <p style=\"font-size:26px;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.4;\">Le proxy / serveur web attendait une réponse de la BDD qui n'est jamais arrivée.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:32px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">@LeDevCodeur</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">SWIPE &gt;&gt;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
          "order": 4,
          "notes": "Slide 5 - 500 vs 504"
        },
        {
          "id": "9616afa4-2b6f-4d13-8453-def3a7226b5b",
          "html": "<div style=\"width:1080px;height:1350px;background:#0A0A0F;color:#F8FAFC;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:90px 80px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">RECAP &amp; ACTION</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:72px;font-weight:800;color:#F8FAFC;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.1;\">Prêt à maîtriser le Web ?</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:28px;color:#94A3B8;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 48px auto;line-height:1.4;\">1 concept tech ou IA vulgarisé chaque jour pour booster ton niveau de dev.</p>\n          <div style=\"background:#12121A;border:2px solid #22D3EE;border-radius:24px;padding:40px;box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(34,211,238,0.15);display:inline-block;\">\n            <div style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:40px;color:#22D3EE;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:12px;\">@LeDevCodeur</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:24px;color:#A855F7;\">Abonne-toi pour ne rien manquer</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-around;border-top:1px solid #1E293B;padding-top:36px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#94A3B8;font-size:22px;\">❤️ Like</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#22D3EE;font-size:22px;\">🔖 Sauvegarde</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#A855F7;font-size:22px;\">🚀 Partage</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
